title: Reconcile duplicate ownership of GitHub issue #5 blocking the gated tracker sync
description: "Tracks gh:unbraind/pm-rlm#49 (filed 2026-11-01, missed by the blind issue watch). The scheduled gated sync still fails the ownership preflight ('GitHub issue #5 has multiple existing owners') on current main: two closed records both claim the source issue — the imported issue item holds the gh: tag/github_url, and the other closed record (pm-rlm-sr0b) begins its description with the source issue URL, which the identity contract treats as a competing ownership declaration. Latest failing run 41297675184 (2026-11-01T10:29Z, pm-github 2026.10.29); the 10-31 run passed, the 11-01 run after the sync-workflow bump refuses again. Reconcile exactly one import owner with supported PM operations while preserving both records' knowledge, evidence and durable history (reword the competing description or convert it to a structured relationship); keep the fail-closed guard."
